# BudSignal is free and needs no configuration to run.
#
# Market data comes from the free public CoinGecko API (no key required).
# When that API is unreachable, the app falls back to clearly-labelled demo
# data automatically, so the whole thing works offline with no setup.
#
# Optional: if you later sign up for a CoinGecko Demo/Pro API key you can wire
# it into lib/data.ts to raise rate limits — but nothing here requires it.
